  "description": "TUXXES crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C114 H84 Eu6 N18 O42,4(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu5 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu6 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.124-4.139 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 111.69-118.81°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C122H96Eu6N22O42.",
